CLAUDE.md:9:- **Gateway** (`gateway/app/backend/main.py`) — port 8788. Receives uploads, queues jobs in PostgreSQL, dispatches to workers over HTTP.
CLAUDE.md:10:- **Worker(s)** (`worker/app/backend/main.py`) — port 8789. Run the ffmpeg pipelines and return the rendered MP4.
CLAUDE.md:14:Live deployment lives behind nginx at `https://green.cutdee.com/v3api/...` (path-based proxy on `127.0.0.1:8788`).
CLAUDE.md:34:ruff check gateway/app/backend/main.py worker/app/backend/main.py
CLAUDE.md:35:ruff format --check gateway/app/backend/main.py worker/app/backend/main.py
CLAUDE.md:41:### Install / deploy (systemd, single host dev)
CLAUDE.md:49:The installer writes `gateway/.venv` and `worker/.venv`, creates `/etc/v3-cursor-api/{gateway,worker}.env`, generates systemd units, and seeds `/var/lib/v3-cursor-api/gateway/workers.json` with one local worker. Re-running is safe; env files and `workers.json` are only created if missing.
CLAUDE.md:51:### Run from the repo without systemd
CLAUDE.md:56:python3 -m venv .venv && .venv/bin/pip install -r requirements.txt
CLAUDE.md:59:.venv/bin/python -m uvicorn app.backend.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8788
CLAUDE.md:63:python3 -m venv .venv && .venv/bin/pip install -r requirements.txt
CLAUDE.md:67:.venv/bin/python -m uvicorn app.backend.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8789
CLAUDE.md:75:curl http://127.0.0.1:8788/healthz
CLAUDE.md:82:The gateway auto-creates the `v3_jobs` table in schema `v3_jobs` on startup (via `_init_schema` in `gateway/app/backend/main.py`) and applies idempotent migrations. Database is reached through PgBouncer (transaction mode, SCRAM-SHA-256) on the standard `v3_cursor_api` database. Configured by `CUTDEE_PG_*` env vars; defaults assume PgBouncer on `127.0.0.1:6432`.
CLAUDE.md:97:The gateway has been refactored (Phase 1–3) out of one ~2k-line `main.py` into a layout you should default to:
CLAUDE.md:99:- `gateway/app/backend/main.py` — wiring only: FastAPI app construction, static-file mount, lifespan startup (`_init_schema`, etc.), and the `if __name__ == "__main__": uvicorn.run(...)` block.
CLAUDE.md:102:- `gateway/app/backend/routers/` — one file per resource, all wired from `main.py`: `auth.py`, `cluster.py`, `jobs.py`, `pages.py`, `system.py`, `uploads.py`, `users.py`, `ws.py`. New endpoints should land in a router here, not in `main.py`.
CLAUDE.md:103:- `gateway/app/backend/templates/` — extracted HTML for the page routes (formerly inline in `main.py`).
CLAUDE.md:107:When asked to "add an endpoint to the gateway", reach for `routers/<topic>.py` + a service in `services/` first; only touch `main.py` for app wiring or new lifespan hooks.
CLAUDE.md:111:The worker is still a single `worker/app/backend/main.py` (~39KB FastAPI app) on top of the vendored `core/`. New pipeline code goes in `core/pipelines/` (see `worker/app/backend/core/pipelines/tc0N_*.py` and `_common.py`); new settings factories go in `core/contract.py`.
CLAUDE.md:116:2. Client posts a job (`POST /api/v1/jobs` or `POST /api/{tc}/render`). Gateway:
CLAUDE.md:123:4. Client downloads the MP4 via `GET /api/v1/jobs/{id}/download/{file}` — gateway proxies from the worker and caches under `OUTPUTS_DIR`.
CLAUDE.md:132:Public liveness (`/healthz`, `/health`) is unauthenticated.
CLAUDE.md:177:- **Do not edit `worker/app/backend/core/`** as if it were this repo's source. It is a vendored copy of `V3_cursor/core/`. New pipeline code goes in `worker/app/backend/main.py` or a new sibling module, and settings factories go in `core/contract.py`.
CLAUDE.md:182:- **Auth header** for gateway↔worker RPC is exactly `X-Cutdee-Internal`, value must match `CUTDEE_INTERNAL_TOKEN` env on both sides. The header is checked by `_verify_internal` in both `main.py` files.
CLAUDE.md:207:- The `api_render_tc` handler at `/api/render/{tc}` and the dynamic `/api/{tc}/render` endpoints both upload files to the worker under the role name. Don't confuse the gateway's filename minting with the worker's — the gateway always uses `.mp4`; the worker uses whatever the gateway sends in `Content-Disposition`.
